      {
        "text": "State Rep. Tracy Katz Muhl, an attorney, has represented the 57th District since 2024. She previously led the Northbrook School District 28 Board of Education, where she says she implemented free full-day kindergarten, and she serves as the Northfield Township Democratic committeeperson. She has volunteered with Moms Demand Action and LGBTQ+ advocacy groups.",
